# Formspree form id for the contact form (Contact section).
# Create a form at https://formspree.io, then set this to the id after /f/ in
# your endpoint (e.g. https://formspree.io/f/xxxxxxx -> xxxxxxx).
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill it in. Until it is set, the form shows a
# friendly "email me directly" message instead of submitting.
NEXT_PUBLIC_FORMSPREE_ID=
